  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals 4 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals x squared minus 12\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>12</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A solution to the given system of equations is&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where&nbsp;<math alttext=\"x greater than 0\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
